      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Non è un LLM\n\n- 740 milioni di parametri\n\n- Multimodale\n    > testo\n    > video\n    > audio\n\n- \"On a Google Pixel 11 Pro requires as little as ~191MB active RAM for text-only\nweights and ~567MB for the full multimodal model.\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Non è un LLM\n\n- 740 milioni di parametri\n\n- Multimodale\n    > testo\n    > video\n    > audio\n\n- \"On a Google Pixel 11 Pro requires as little as ~191MB active RAM for text-only weights and ~567MB for the full multimodal model.\"",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
